#. Key:	AnimNode_KawaiiPhysicsSharedPublisher
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member AnimNode_KawaiiPhysicsSharedPublisher in None (type: ScriptStruct, owner: AnimNode_KawaiiPhysicsSharedPublisher)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member AnimNode_KawaiiPhysicsSharedPublisher in None (type: ScriptStruct, owner: AnimNode_KawaiiPhysicsSharedPublisher)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,AnimNode_KawaiiPhysicsSharedPublisher"
msgid "Kawaii Physics ノード群が共有する Simple World Collision の収集設定と風の状態を、同じ Shared Group Tag を持つノードへ配る pass-through ノード。1 キャラ（Actor ファミリー）に 1 個、本体メッシュの Post Process AnimBP または Output Pose 直前の幹（Blend で weight 0 にならない位置）に置く。\nA pass-through node that publishes Simple World Collision gather settings and wind state to every Kawaii Physics node sharing the same Shared Group Tag. Place one per character (actor family) in the body mesh's Post Process AnimBP or on the trunk right before Output Pose (a branch whose blend weight never reaches zero)."
msgstr "将 Kawaii Physics 节点群共享的简易世界碰撞收集设置与风状态分发给具有相同共享组标签节点的直通节点，每个角色（Actor 家族）放 1 个，放在本体网格的后期处理动画蓝图或输出姿势之前的干路上，混合权重不会变为 0 的位置"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsCollisionDrawStyle:AnimNodeColor
