#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member bAllowWorldCollision in AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics (type: BoolProperty, owner: AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics:bAllowWorldCollision"
msgid "レベル上の各コリジョンとの判定を行うフラグ。有効にすると物理処理の負荷が大幅に上がります\nFlag for collision detection with each collision on the level. Enabling this will significantly increase the load of physics processing."
msgstr "是否与关卡中的各碰撞体进行判定的开关，启用后物理处理负载会大幅上升"

#. Key:	AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics:bAutoAddChildDummyBoneConstraint
