#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member bAutoAddChildDummyBoneConstraint in AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics (type: BoolProperty, owner: AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics:bAutoAddChildDummyBoneConstraint"
msgid "末端ボーンをBoneConstraint処理の対象にした場合、自動的にダミーボーンも処理対象にするフラグ\nFlag to automatically processes dummy bones when the end bones are subject to BoneConstraint processing."
msgstr "当末端骨骼作为骨骼约束处理对象时，自动将虚拟骨骼也纳入处理对象"

#. Key:	AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics:bBoneSubdivisionCollisionOnly
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member bBoneSubdivisionCollisionOnly in AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics (type: BoolProperty, owner: AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member bBoneSubdivisionCollisionOnly in AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics (type: BoolProperty, owner: AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics:bBoneSubdivisionCollisionOnly"
msgid "ボーン間ダミーボーンの速度積分（重力・風など）をスキップし、実ボーン間の補間位置からコリジョン・制約に参加（配置数には影響しない）。\nWhen true, inter-bone dummy bones skip velocity integration (gravity/wind/etc.) and participate in collision and constraints from interpolated positions. Does not affect the number of dummies."
msgstr "跳过骨骼间虚拟骨骼的速度积分（重力、风等），并让其从实际骨骼间的插值位置参与碰撞与约束，不影响虚拟骨骼的放置数量"

