#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member bGatherFamilyMembers in KawaiiPhysicsSimpleWorldCollisionSettings (type: BoolProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysicsSimpleWorldCollisionSettings)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysicsSimpleWorldCollisionSettings:bGatherFamilyMembers"
msgid "同じ Entry に参加する他のメッシュ（ファミリー内メンバー）も Skeletal Mesh Collision のモードで収集し、各ノードは自分以外のメンバーの形状と衝突します。Object Types に Pawn を含める必要があります。\nAlso gathers other meshes participating in the same Entry (family members) with the Skeletal Mesh Collision mode, so each node collides with member shapes except its own. Object Types must include Pawn."
msgstr "参与同一 Entry 的其他网格（家族内成员）也会以骨骼网格体碰撞模式收集，各节点会与除自身以外的成员形状碰撞，Object Types 需包含 Pawn"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSimpleWorldCollisionSettings:bGroundCollision
