#. Key:	AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics:bUpdatePhysicsSettingsInGame
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member bUpdatePhysicsSettingsInGame in AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics (type: BoolProperty, owner: AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics)
