#. Key:	KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_Gravity:bUseOverrideGravityDirection
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member bUseOverrideGravityDirection in KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_Gravity (type: BoolProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_Gravity)
