#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSimpleWorldCollisionSettings:ConvexFallbackShape
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member ConvexFallbackShape in KawaiiPhysicsSimpleWorldCollisionSettings (type: EnumProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysicsSimpleWorldCollisionSettings)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member ConvexFallbackShape in KawaiiPhysicsSimpleWorldCollisionSettings (type: EnumProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysicsSimpleWorldCollisionSettings)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysicsSimpleWorldCollisionSettings:ConvexFallbackShape"
msgid "Simple World Collision で Convex コリジョンに使う形状。既定の Convex Hull は実形状の平面セットをそのまま使い、ハル情報を取得できない場合や平面数が Max Convex Planes を超える場合は Bounding Box で代用します。\nShape used for convex collision in Simple World Collision. The default Convex Hull uses the actual plane set, falling back to the bounding box when hull data is unavailable or the plane count exceeds Max Convex Planes."
msgstr "简易世界碰撞中用于凸碰撞的形状，默认 Convex Hull 直接使用实际形状的平面集合，当无法取得壳信息或平面数超过 Max Convex Planes 时则改用包围盒"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_Curve:CurveEvaluateType
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member CurveEvaluateType in KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_Curve (type: EnumProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_Curve)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member CurveEvaluateType in KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_Curve (type: EnumProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_Curve)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_Curve:CurveEvaluateType"
msgid "カーブの評価方式。\nSingle以外に設定した場合：前フレームからの経過時間をSubstepCountで分割し、\n分割後の各時間におけるカーブの値の平均・最大値・最小値を外力として使用\nCurve evaluation method\nIf set to anything other than Single: The time elapsed from the previous frame is divided by SubstepCount,\nand the Average, Maximum, or Minimum values of the curve at each time point after division are used as external forces."
msgstr "曲线求值方式，设置为 Single 以外时，将距上一帧经过的时间按 SubstepCount 分割，取分割后各时间点曲线值的平均、最大或最小值作为外力"

#. Key:	AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics:CustomExternalForces
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member CustomExternalForces in AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics (type: ArrayProperty, owner: AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member CustomExternalForces in AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics (type: ArrayProperty, owner: AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics:CustomExternalForces"
msgid "EXPERIMENTAL: 外力のプリセット。BP・C++で独自のプリセットを追加可能(Instanced Property)\n注意：AnimNodeをクリック or ABPをコンパイルしないと正常に動作しません\nExternal force presets (experimental). You can add your own presets in BP or C++.\nNote: If you do not click on AnimNode or compile ABP, it will not work properly."
msgstr "实验性：外力预设，可在蓝图或 C++ 中添加自定义预设（Instanced Property），注意：若不点击动画节点或编译动画蓝图则无法正常工作"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSettings:Damping
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member Damping in KawaiiPhysicsSettings (type: FloatProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysicsSettings)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member Damping in KawaiiPhysicsSettings (type: FloatProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysicsSettings)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysicsSettings:Damping"
msgid "減衰度：揺れの強さを制御。値が小さいほど、加速度を物理挙動に反映\nDamping physical behavior. As the value is smaller, the acceleration is more reflected to the physical behavior"
msgstr "衰减度，控制摇曳的强度，值越小加速度越反映到物理行为"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:Damping
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member Damping in KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier (type: FloatProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member Damping in KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier (type: FloatProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:Damping"
msgid "Dampingへの倍率。1未満で減衰が弱まり、揺れが大きくなる\nMultiplier for Damping. Below 1 the damping weakens and the sway grows."
msgstr "阻尼的倍率，低于 1 时衰减减弱，摇曳变大"

#. Key:	MovieSceneKawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplierSection:Damping
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member Damping in MovieSceneKawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplierSection (type: StructProperty, owner: MovieSceneKawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplierSection)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member Damping in MovieSceneKawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplierSection (type: StructProperty, owner: MovieSceneKawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplierSection)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,MovieSceneKawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplierSection:Damping"
msgid "Dampingへの倍率。1未満で減衰が弱まり、揺れが大きくなる / Multiplier for Damping. Below 1 the damping weakens and the sway grows."
msgstr "阻尼的倍率，低于 1 时衰减减弱，摇曳变大"

#. Key:	AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics:DampingCurveData
