#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSimpleWorldCollisionSettings:GatherInterval
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member GatherInterval in KawaiiPhysicsSimpleWorldCollisionSettings (type: FloatProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysicsSimpleWorldCollisionSettings)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member GatherInterval in KawaiiPhysicsSimpleWorldCollisionSettings (type: FloatProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysicsSimpleWorldCollisionSettings)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysicsSimpleWorldCollisionSettings:GatherInterval"
msgid "シンプルワールドコリジョンの収集間隔（秒）。0の場合は毎フレーム収集します。収集済みコンポーネントの位置更新は毎フレーム行われます。\nGather interval for Simple World Collision in seconds. 0 gathers every frame. Already gathered component transforms are updated every frame."
msgstr "简易世界碰撞的收集间隔（秒），为 0 时每帧收集，已收集组件的位置每帧更新"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSimpleWorldCollisionSettings:GatherRadius
