#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsPerAxisLimitAngle
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member KawaiiPhysicsPerAxisLimitAngle in None (type: ScriptStruct, owner: KawaiiPhysicsPerAxisLimitAngle)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member KawaiiPhysicsPerAxisLimitAngle in None (type: ScriptStruct, owner: KawaiiPhysicsPerAxisLimitAngle)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysicsPerAxisLimitAngle"
msgid "親ボーンのローカル軸ごとの角度制限。BoneForwardAxis と同じ軸はツイストにあたり、KawaiiPhysics はツイストを生成しないため無視される。\n有効な2軸の値は楕円状につながり、値が等しければ円錐と一致する\nAngle limit per local axis of the parent bone. The axis matching BoneForwardAxis is the twist axis; KawaiiPhysics never produces twist, so it is ignored.\nThe two active axes form an elliptical boundary that matches a cone when their values are equal."
msgstr "父骨骼每个局部轴的角度限制，与 BoneForwardAxis 相同的轴为扭转轴，KawaiiPhysics 不产生扭转因此被忽略，两个有效轴的值构成椭圆边界，值相等时与圆锥一致"

