msgstr "表示物理控制设置的结构体"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier in None (type: ScriptStruct, owner: KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier in None (type: ScriptStruct, owner: KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier"
msgid "物理設定への一時的な倍率。全項目の既定値 1.0 は「変更なし」。ベースの設定値は書き換えず、毎フレーム再計算される各ボーンの実効値に乗算する\nTemporary multipliers for physics settings. Every value defaults to 1.0 (no change). The base settings are never rewritten;\nthe multipliers are applied to each bone's effective values, which are recomputed every frame."
msgstr "对物理设置的临时倍率，所有项默认值 1.0 为不变，不会重写基础设置值，而是乘到每帧重新计算的各骨骼有效值上"

