#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSettings:LimitAngle
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member LimitAngle in KawaiiPhysicsSettings (type: FloatProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysicsSettings)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member LimitAngle in KawaiiPhysicsSettings (type: FloatProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysicsSettings)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysicsSettings:LimitAngle"
msgid "物理挙動による回転制限。適切に設定することで荒ぶりを抑制。0で制限なし\nRotational limitations in physical behavior. Setting the value properly can suppress excessive shaking. 0 means no limit"
msgstr "物理行为的旋转限制，适当设置可抑制抖动，0 表示无限制"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:LimitAngle
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member LimitAngle in KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier (type: FloatProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member LimitAngle in KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier (type: FloatProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:LimitAngle"
msgid "LimitAngleへの倍率。ベースが0（無制限）のボーンは倍率に関わらず無制限のまま。ベースが0より大きいボーンは\n極小値で下限クランプされ、倍率0でも無制限へは反転せず、ほぼ完全にポーズへ追従する。Per Axis モードでは全軸の Min/Max に掛かり、倍率0で全軸ロックになる\nMultiplier for LimitAngle. Bones whose base value is 0 (unlimited) stay unlimited whatever the multiplier is.\nBones with a base above 0 are clamped to a tiny positive minimum, so even a multiplier of 0 never flips them back to\nunlimited; they follow the pose almost exactly instead. In Per Axis mode it scales Min/Max of every axis, and a multiplier of 0 locks them all."
msgstr "角度限制的倍率，基础值为 0 即无限制的骨骼无论倍率如何都保持无限制，基础值大于 0 的骨骼会被下限钳制在极小值，即使倍率为 0 也不会翻转为无限制而是几乎完全跟随姿势，Per Axis 模式下会乘到全轴的上下限，倍率为 0 时全轴锁定"

#. Key:	MovieSceneKawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplierSection:LimitAngle
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member LimitAngle in MovieSceneKawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplierSection (type: StructProperty, owner: MovieSceneKawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplierSection)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member LimitAngle in MovieSceneKawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplierSection (type: StructProperty, owner: MovieSceneKawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplierSection)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,MovieSceneKawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplierSection:LimitAngle"
msgid "LimitAngleへの倍率。ベースが0（無制限）のボーンは倍率に関わらず無制限のまま。ベースが0より大きいボーンは\n極小値で下限クランプされ、倍率0でも無制限へは反転せず、ほぼ完全にポーズへ追従する。Per Axis モードでは全軸の Min/Max に掛かり、倍率0で全軸ロックになる\nMultiplier for LimitAngle. Bones whose base value is 0 (unlimited) stay unlimited whatever the multiplier is.\nBones with a base above 0 are clamped to a tiny positive minimum, so even a multiplier of 0 never flips them back to\nunlimited; they follow the pose almost exactly instead. In Per Axis mode it scales Min/Max of every axis, and a multiplier of 0 locks them all."
msgstr "角度限制的倍率，基础值为 0 即无限制的骨骼无论倍率如何都保持无限制，基础值大于 0 的骨骼会被下限钳制在极小值，即使倍率为 0 也不会翻转为无限制而是几乎完全跟随姿势，逐轴模式下会乘到全轴的上下限，倍率为 0 时全轴锁定"

#. Key:	AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics:LimitAngleCurveData
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member LimitAngleCurveData in AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics (type: StructProperty, owner: AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member LimitAngleCurveData in AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics (type: StructProperty, owner: AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics:LimitAngleCurveData"
msgid "各ボーンに適用するPhysics Settings/ LimitAngle パラメータを補正。Per Axis モードでは全軸の Min/Max に乗算\n「RootBoneから特定のボーンまでの長さ / RootBoneから末端のボーンまでの長さ」(0.0~1.0)の値におけるカーブの値を各パラメータに乗算\nCorrects the Physics Settings/LimitAngle parameters applied to each bone. In Per Axis mode it scales Min/Max of every axis.\nMultiplies each parameter by the curve value for \"Length from RootBone to specific bone / Length from RootBone to end bone\" (0.0~1.0)."
msgstr "修正各骨骼应用的物理设置/角度限制参数，在 Per Axis 模式下会乘到全轴的 Min/Max，按「根骨骼到特定骨骼的长度 / 根骨骼到末端骨骼的长度」（0.0~1.0）取曲线值并乘到各参数上"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSettings:LimitAngleMode
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member LimitAngleMode in KawaiiPhysicsSettings (type: EnumProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysicsSettings)
