#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSimpleWorldCollisionSettings:ObjectTypes
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member ObjectTypes in KawaiiPhysicsSimpleWorldCollisionSettings (type: ArrayProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysicsSimpleWorldCollisionSettings)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member ObjectTypes in KawaiiPhysicsSimpleWorldCollisionSettings (type: ArrayProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysicsSimpleWorldCollisionSettings)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysicsSimpleWorldCollisionSettings:ObjectTypes"
msgid "シンプルワールドコリジョンが反応するオブジェクトタイプ。空の場合は WorldStatic + WorldDynamic を使用します。収集されるのは、これらのタイプに属し、かつ所有 SkeletalMeshComponent の ObjectType（Override SkelComp Collision Params 有効時はその ObjectType）を Block するコンポーネントだけです。Overlap / Ignore 応答（トリガー等）は収集しません。bGatherFamilyMembers を使うときは Pawn を含める必要があります。\nObject types used by Simple World Collision. Empty means WorldStatic + WorldDynamic. Only components of these types that Block the owning SkeletalMeshComponent's ObjectType (or the ObjectType from Override SkelComp Collision Params when enabled) are gathered. Overlap / Ignore responses (triggers, etc.) are never gathered. Include Pawn when using bGatherFamilyMembers."
msgstr "简易世界碰撞响应的对象类型，为空时使用 WorldStatic 与 WorldDynamic，仅收集属于这些类型、且会阻挡拥有者骨骼网格体组件 ObjectType 的组件（启用覆盖骨骼组件碰撞参数时则为该 ObjectType），重叠与忽略响应（触发器 等）不会被收集，使用 bGatherFamilyMembers 时必须包含 Pawn"

