#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:Radius
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member Radius in KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier (type: FloatProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member Radius in KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier (type: FloatProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:Radius"
msgid "コリジョン半径への倍率。0にするとワールドコリジョンのスイープと押し出しが実質無効になる。\n半径によるダミーボーンの本数はベースの半径から決まるため、1未満ではコリジョンの被覆に隙間が生じうる\nMultiplier for the collision radius. At 0 the world sweep and push-out are effectively disabled.\nThe radius-based dummy bone count comes from the base radius, so below 1 the collision coverage can leave gaps."
msgstr "碰撞半径的倍率，为 0 时世界碰撞的扫掠与推出实质无效，基于半径的虚拟骨骼数量由基础半径决定，低于 1 时碰撞覆盖可能出现缝隙"

#. Key:	MovieSceneKawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplierSection:Radius
