#. Key:	KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:RippleForce
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member RippleForce in KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind (type: FloatProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member RippleForce in KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind (type: FloatProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:RippleForce"
msgid "根元から毛先へ伝播する波揺れ(Ripple)の振幅。伝播の要は RippleTipPhaseDelay で、0 だと Sway と同じ動きになる。Wind Scope の Ripple 系列に対応\nAmplitude of the wave that travels from root to tip. RippleTipPhaseDelay drives the propagation; at 0 the motion matches Sway. Corresponds to the Ripple series in Wind Scope."
msgstr "从根部向发梢传播的波动（Ripple）振幅，传播的关键在 RippleTipPhaseDelay，为 0 时动作与 Sway 相同，对应风示波器的 Ripple 系列"

#. Key:	KawaiiProceduralWindDynamicParams:RippleForce
