msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiProceduralWindDynamicParams:RippleForce"
msgid "波揺れ(Ripple)の振幅 / Spatial wave amplitude."
msgstr "波动（Ripple）的振幅"

#. Key:	KawaiiProceduralWindPreset:RippleForce
