#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member RippleForce in KawaiiProceduralWindPreset (type: FloatProperty, owner: KawaiiProceduralWindPreset)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiProceduralWindPreset:RippleForce"
msgid "ボーン列に沿って伝わる波揺れ(Ripple)成分の振幅 / Amplitude of the traveling wave along the bone chain."
msgstr "沿骨骼链传播的波动（Ripple）成分振幅"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:RipplePeriod
