#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member RipplePeriod in KawaiiProceduralWindPreset (type: FloatProperty, owner: KawaiiProceduralWindPreset)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiProceduralWindPreset:RipplePeriod"
msgid "波揺れ(Ripple)の周期（秒） / Ripple period in seconds."
msgstr "波动（Ripple）的周期（秒）"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:RipplePhaseOffset
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member RipplePhaseOffset in KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind (type: FloatProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member RipplePhaseOffset in KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind (type: FloatProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:RipplePhaseOffset"
msgid "波揺れ(Ripple)の開始位相オフセット。複数キャラや複数外力で波のタイミングを分散する用途。Wind Scope の Ripple 系列に対応\nStart phase offset of the traveling wave. Use to stagger wave timing across multiple characters or external forces. Corresponds to the Ripple series in Wind Scope."
msgstr "波动（Ripple）的起始相位偏移，用于在多个角色或多个外力间错开波的时机，对应风示波器的 Ripple 系列"

#. Key:	KawaiiProceduralWindDynamicParams:RipplePhaseOffset
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member RipplePhaseOffset in KawaiiProceduralWindDynamicParams (type: FloatProperty, owner: KawaiiProceduralWindDynamicParams)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member RipplePhaseOffset in KawaiiProceduralWindDynamicParams (type: FloatProperty, owner: KawaiiProceduralWindDynamicParams)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiProceduralWindDynamicParams:RipplePhaseOffset"
msgid "波揺れ(Ripple)の位相 / Spatial wave phase."
msgstr "波动（Ripple）的相位"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:RippleTipPhaseDelay
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member RippleTipPhaseDelay in KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind (type: FloatProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member RippleTipPhaseDelay in KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind (type: FloatProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:RippleTipPhaseDelay"
msgid "毛先（LengthRate=1）での位相遅れ角。伝播の要で、0 だと Sway と同じ動きになる。波が根元から毛先へ走り抜ける時間 = RipplePeriod × (TipPhaseDelay/360°)。負値で毛先→根元へ逆走。Wind Scope の Ripple 系列に対応\nPhase delay at the tip (LengthRate=1). This drives the propagation; at 0 the motion matches Sway. Travel time from root to tip = RipplePeriod x (TipPhaseDelay/360deg). Negative values make the wave travel from tip to root. Corresponds to the Ripple series in Wind Scope."
msgstr "发梢（LengthRate=1）的相位延迟角，是传播的关键，为 0 时动作与 Sway 相同，波从根部走到发梢的时间 = RipplePeriod × (TipPhaseDelay/360°)，负值则波从发梢反向跑到根部，对应风示波器的 Ripple 系列"

#. Key:	KawaiiProceduralWindDynamicParams:RippleTipPhaseDelay
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member RippleTipPhaseDelay in KawaiiProceduralWindDynamicParams (type: FloatProperty, owner: KawaiiProceduralWindDynamicParams)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member RippleTipPhaseDelay in KawaiiProceduralWindDynamicParams (type: FloatProperty, owner: KawaiiProceduralWindDynamicParams)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiProceduralWindDynamicParams:RippleTipPhaseDelay"
msgid "毛先 r=1 での位相遅れ量 / Phase delay at tip r=1."
msgstr "发梢 r=1 处的相位延迟量"

#. Key:	KawaiiProceduralWindPreset:RippleTipPhaseDelay
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member RippleTipPhaseDelay in KawaiiProceduralWindPreset (type: FloatProperty, owner: KawaiiProceduralWindPreset)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member RippleTipPhaseDelay in KawaiiProceduralWindPreset (type: FloatProperty, owner: KawaiiProceduralWindPreset)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiProceduralWindPreset:RippleTipPhaseDelay"
msgid "毛先（LengthRate=1）での位相遅れ量 / Phase delay at the tip."
msgstr "发梢（LengthRate=1）处的相位延迟量"

