msgid "移動を適用する度合い\nDegree to apply translation (how much movement is applied)"
msgstr "应用移动的强度"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSyncTargetRoot:ScaleCurveByBoneLengthRate
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member ScaleCurveByBoneLengthRate in KawaiiPhysicsSyncTargetRoot (type: StructProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysicsSyncTargetRoot)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member ScaleCurveByBoneLengthRate in KawaiiPhysicsSyncTargetRoot (type: StructProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysicsSyncTargetRoot)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysicsSyncTargetRoot:ScaleCurveByBoneLengthRate"
msgid "TargetRootからの長さ割合に応じてSyncBoneの影響度にスケールを適用（X: LengthRate、Y: Scale）\nCurve that scales SyncBone's influence based on length rate from TargetRoot (X: Length, Y: Scale)"
msgstr "根据距目标根的长度比例对同步骨骼的影响度进行缩放，X 为长度比例，Y 为缩放"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSyncBone:ScaleCurveByDeltaDistance
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member ScaleCurveByDeltaDistance in KawaiiPhysicsSyncBone (type: StructProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysicsSyncBone)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member ScaleCurveByDeltaDistance in KawaiiPhysicsSyncBone (type: StructProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysicsSyncBone)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysicsSyncBone:ScaleCurveByDeltaDistance"
msgid "SyncBoneの移動距離に応じて\n各Targetに対しての補正処理にスケールをかけるカーブ（X: 移動距離、Y: スケール）\nCurve that scales correction for each Target based on SyncBone's movement distance (X: Distance, Y: Scale)"
msgstr "根据同步骨骼的移动距离，对每个目标的修正处理进行缩放的曲线，X 为移动距离，Y 为缩放"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSyncBone:ScaledDeltaDistance
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member ScaledDeltaDistance in KawaiiPhysicsSyncBone (type: StructProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysicsSyncBone)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member ScaledDeltaDistance in KawaiiPhysicsSyncBone (type: StructProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysicsSyncBone)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysicsSyncBone:ScaledDeltaDistance"
msgid "SyncBoneの移動距離(Alpha, Scale計算後)\nSyncBone movement distance (after Alpha and Scale calculations)"
msgstr "同步骨骼的移动距离，Alpha 与缩放计算后"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:Seed
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member Seed in KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind (type: IntProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member Seed in KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind (type: IntProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:Seed"
msgid "この外力内の全ランダム要素（Random 系列と WindDirectionNoise）に共通のシード。同じ値なら同じ揺らぎを再現できる。PIE中のライブ反映対象外（次回再生から反映）\nSeed shared by every random element in this force (the Random series and WindDirectionNoise). Same seed reproduces the same fluctuation. Not live-updated during PIE; takes effect from the next play session."
msgstr "此外力内所有随机元素（Random 系列与 WindDirectionNoise）共用的种子，相同值可复现相同的波动，不支持 PIE 中实时生效，从下次播放起生效"

#. Key:	AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics:SharedCollisionGroupTag
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member SharedCollisionGroupTag in AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics (type: StructProperty, owner: AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member SharedCollisionGroupTag in AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics (type: StructProperty, owner: AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics:SharedCollisionGroupTag"
msgid "共有コリジョンのグループタグ（同じActor/ChildActorファミリー内のSource/Target両方で使用）\nGroup tag for shared collision (used by both source and target in the same attached actor family)"
msgstr "共享碰撞的组标签，同一 Actor/ChildActor 家族内的 Source 与 Target 双方都会使用"

#. Key:	AnimNode_KawaiiPhysicsSharedPublisher:SharedGroupTag
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member SharedGroupTag in AnimNode_KawaiiPhysicsSharedPublisher (type: StructProperty, owner: AnimNode_KawaiiPhysicsSharedPublisher)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member SharedGroupTag in AnimNode_KawaiiPhysicsSharedPublisher (type: StructProperty, owner: AnimNode_KawaiiPhysicsSharedPublisher)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,AnimNode_KawaiiPhysicsSharedPublisher:SharedGroupTag"
msgid "消費側ノードの Shared Tag と一致させる。同じ Actor ファミリー内で同じ Tag の Publisher は 1 個だけ。\nMust match the consumers' Shared Tag. Only one publisher per tag per actor family."
msgstr "需与消费侧节点的共享标签一致，同一 Actor 家族内同一标签的发布器只允许 1 个"

#. Key:	AnimNode_KawaiiPhysicsSharedPublisher:SharedWind
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member SharedWind in AnimNode_KawaiiPhysicsSharedPublisher (type: StructProperty, owner: AnimNode_KawaiiPhysicsSharedPublisher)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member SharedWind in AnimNode_KawaiiPhysicsSharedPublisher (type: StructProperty, owner: AnimNode_KawaiiPhysicsSharedPublisher)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,AnimNode_KawaiiPhysicsSharedPublisher:SharedWind"
msgid "共有する ProceduralWind。本ノードでは風の位相クロック（Time）と有効フラグだけを配る。風のパラメータと突風の共有は後続の更新で有効になる。\nProceduralWind shared with consumers. This node currently publishes the wind clock (Time) and enabled flag; parameter and gust sharing arrives in a later change."
msgstr "共享的程序化风，本节点目前只分发风的相位时钟（Time）与启用标记，风的参数与阵风共享将在后续更新中启用"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:SharedWindTag
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member SharedWindTag in KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind (type: StructProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member SharedWindTag in KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind (type: StructProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:SharedWindTag"
msgid "Shared / Auto のときに参照する Shared Publisher の Shared Group Tag。Publisher 側の Shared Group Tag と一致させる\nShared Group Tag of the Shared Publisher used in Shared / Auto mode. Must match the publisher's Shared Group Tag."
msgstr "Shared / Auto 时参照的共享发布器的共享组标签，需与发布器侧的共享组标签一致"

#. Key:	AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics:SimpleExternalForce
