#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member SimpleExternalForce in AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics (type: StructProperty, owner: AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics:SimpleExternalForce"
msgid "単純な外力ベクトル\nSimple external force vector"
msgstr "简易的外力向量"

#. Key:	AnimNode_KawaiiPhysicsSharedPublisher:SimpleWorldCollision
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member SimpleWorldCollision in AnimNode_KawaiiPhysicsSharedPublisher (type: StructProperty, owner: AnimNode_KawaiiPhysicsSharedPublisher)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member SimpleWorldCollision in AnimNode_KawaiiPhysicsSharedPublisher (type: StructProperty, owner: AnimNode_KawaiiPhysicsSharedPublisher)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,AnimNode_KawaiiPhysicsSharedPublisher:SimpleWorldCollision"
msgid "Simple World Collision の収集設定。bGatherFamilyMembers を使う場合は ObjectTypes に Pawn を含める。\nGather settings for Simple World Collision. Include Pawn in ObjectTypes when using bGatherFamilyMembers."
msgstr "简易世界碰撞的收集设置，使用 bGatherFamilyMembers 时需在 ObjectTypes 中包含 Pawn"

#. Key:	AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics:SimpleWorldCollisionConvexFallbackShape
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member SimpleWorldCollisionConvexFallbackShape in AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics (type: EnumProperty, owner: AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member SimpleWorldCollisionConvexFallbackShape in AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics (type: EnumProperty, owner: AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics:SimpleWorldCollisionConvexFallbackShape"
msgid "Simple World Collision で Convex コリジョンに使う形状。既定の Convex Hull は実形状の平面セットをそのまま使い、ハル情報を取得できない場合や平面数が Max Convex Planes を超える場合は Bounding Box で代用します。\nShape used for convex collision in Simple World Collision. The default Convex Hull uses the actual plane set, falling back to the bounding box when hull data is unavailable or the plane count exceeds Max Convex Planes."
msgstr "简易世界碰撞中用于凸碰撞的形状，默认 Convex Hull 直接使用实际形状的平面集合，当无法取得壳信息或平面数超过 Max Convex Planes 时则改用包围盒"

#. Key:	AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics:SimpleWorldCollisionGatherInterval
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member SimpleWorldCollisionGatherInterval in AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics (type: FloatProperty, owner: AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member SimpleWorldCollisionGatherInterval in AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics (type: FloatProperty, owner: AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics:SimpleWorldCollisionGatherInterval"
msgid "シンプルワールドコリジョンの収集間隔（秒）。0の場合は毎フレーム収集します。収集済みコンポーネントの位置更新は毎フレーム行われます。\nGather interval for Simple World Collision in seconds. 0 gathers every frame. Already gathered component transforms are updated every frame."
msgstr "简易世界碰撞的收集间隔（秒），为 0 时每帧收集，已收集组件的位置每帧更新"

#. Key:	AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics:SimpleWorldCollisionGatherRadius
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member SimpleWorldCollisionGatherRadius in AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics (type: FloatProperty, owner: AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member SimpleWorldCollisionGatherRadius in AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics (type: FloatProperty, owner: AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics:SimpleWorldCollisionGatherRadius"
msgid "シンプルワールドコリジョンの収集半径のオーバーライド。無効時は SkeletalMesh の Bounds から自動算出します。\nOverride for the Simple World Collision gather radius. When disabled, it is calculated automatically from SkeletalMesh bounds."
msgstr "简易世界碰撞的收集半径覆盖，禁用时根据骨骼网格体的 Bounds 自动计算"

#. Key:	AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics:SimpleWorldCollisionObjectTypes
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member SimpleWorldCollisionObjectTypes in AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics (type: ArrayProperty, owner: AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member SimpleWorldCollisionObjectTypes in AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics (type: ArrayProperty, owner: AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics:SimpleWorldCollisionObjectTypes"
msgid "シンプルワールドコリジョンが反応するオブジェクトタイプ。空の場合は WorldStatic + WorldDynamic を使用します。収集されるのは、これらのタイプに属し、かつ所有 SkeletalMeshComponent の ObjectType（Override SkelComp Collision Params 有効時はその ObjectType）を Block するコンポーネントだけです。Overlap / Ignore 応答（トリガー等）は収集しません。\nObject types used by Simple World Collision. Empty means WorldStatic + WorldDynamic. Only components of these types that Block the owning SkeletalMeshComponent's ObjectType (or the ObjectType from Override SkelComp Collision Params when enabled) are gathered. Overlap / Ignore responses (triggers, etc.) are never gathered."
msgstr "简易世界碰撞响应的对象类型，为空时使用 WorldStatic + WorldDynamic，仅收集属于这些类型、且会 Block 拥有者骨骼网格体组件的 ObjectType（启用覆盖骨骼组件碰撞参数时则为该 ObjectType）的组件，Overlap / Ignore 响应（触发器 等）不会被收集"

#. Key:	AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics:SimpleWorldCollisionSharedTag
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member SimpleWorldCollisionSharedTag in AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics (type: StructProperty, owner: AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member SimpleWorldCollisionSharedTag in AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics (type: StructProperty, owner: AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics:SimpleWorldCollisionSharedTag"
msgid "Shared / Auto で読む Kawaii Physics Shared Publisher の共有タグ。Shared のとき、既存の収集設定 7 項目（Gather Interval 〜 Skeletal Mesh Collision）は Publisher 側の設定が使われ、このノードの値は無視されます。Auto のときは Local フォールバック時にだけ使われます。\nShared tag for the Kawaii Physics Shared Publisher read by Shared / Auto. In Shared mode, the seven gather settings (Gather Interval through Skeletal Mesh Collision) use the Publisher settings and this node's values are ignored. In Auto mode, they are used only for Local fallback."
msgstr "Shared / Auto 读取的 Kawaii Physics 共享发布器的共享标签，在 Shared 时，现有 7 项收集设置（Gather Interval 至 Skeletal Mesh Collision）使用发布器侧设置，此节点的值被忽略，在 Auto 时，仅在 Local 回退时使用"

#. Key:	AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics:SimpleWorldCollisionSkeletalMeshCollision
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member SimpleWorldCollisionSkeletalMeshCollision in AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics (type: EnumProperty, owner: AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member SimpleWorldCollisionSkeletalMeshCollision in AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics (type: EnumProperty, owner: AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics:SimpleWorldCollisionSkeletalMeshCollision"
msgid "Simple World Collision で収集した周囲の SkeletalMeshComponent との当たり方。None / Bounding Box / Physics Asset から選びます。\nHow Simple World Collision collides with gathered SkeletalMeshComponents: None, Bounding Box, or Physics Asset."
msgstr "简易世界碰撞与收集到的周围骨骼网格体组件的接触方式，可从 None、Bounding Box、Physics Asset 中选择"

#. Key:	AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics:SimpleWorldCollisionSource
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member SimpleWorldCollisionSource in AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics (type: EnumProperty, owner: AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member SimpleWorldCollisionSource in AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics (type: EnumProperty, owner: AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics:SimpleWorldCollisionSource"
msgid "シンプルワールドコリジョンの収集元。Shared のとき、既存の収集設定 7 項目（Gather Interval 〜 Skeletal Mesh Collision）は Publisher 側の設定が使われ、このノードの値は無視されます。Auto のときは Local フォールバック時にだけ使われます。\nSource for Simple World Collision. In Shared mode, the seven gather settings (Gather Interval through Skeletal Mesh Collision) use the Publisher settings and this node's values are ignored. In Auto mode, they are used only for Local fallback."
msgstr "简易世界碰撞的收集来源，在 Shared 时，现有 7 项收集设置（Gather Interval 至 Skeletal Mesh Collision）使用发布器侧设置，此节点的值被忽略，在 Auto 时，仅在 Local 回退时使用"

