msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:SwayForce"
msgid "全ボーンが一斉に同位相で揺れる sin 波の振幅。Ripple との違いは波が伝播しないこと。Wind Scope の Sway 系列に対応\nAmplitude of the sine wave that sways all bones together in the same phase. Unlike Ripple, the wave does not propagate. Corresponds to the Sway series in Wind Scope."
