#. Key:	KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:WindSource
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member WindSource in KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind (type: EnumProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member WindSource in KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind (type: EnumProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:WindSource"
msgid "風の計算元。Shared のとき、共有 13 項目（Wind Direction 〜 Random Force Period）は Publisher の値で毎フレーム上書きされ、このノードの値は無視される。Phase Offset / Seed / Time Scale / Enabled / ボーンフィルタ / 空間はこのノードの値のまま。Auto は Local フォールバック時にだけこのノードの共有 13 項目を使う\nWind source. In Shared mode, the 13 shared fields (Wind Direction through Random Force Period) are overwritten every frame from the Publisher and this node's values are ignored. Phase Offset / Seed / Time Scale / Enabled / bone filters / space stay on this node. Auto uses this node's 13 shared fields only during Local fallback."
msgstr "风的计算来源，在 Shared 时，共享的 13 项（Wind Direction 至 Random Force Period）每帧被发布器的值覆盖，此节点的值被忽略，相位偏移、Seed、Time Scale、Enabled、骨骼筛选、空间仍用此节点的值，Auto 仅在 Local 回退时使用此节点的共享 13 项"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSettings:WorldDampingLocation
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member WorldDampingLocation in KawaiiPhysicsSettings (type: FloatProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysicsSettings)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member WorldDampingLocation in KawaiiPhysicsSettings (type: FloatProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysicsSettings)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysicsSettings:WorldDampingLocation"
msgid "ワールド座標系における Skeletal Mesh Component の移動量のダンピング(抑制)量。\n0 = 移動量をフル反映(揺れ最大) / 1 = コンポーネントに追従(反映なし)。実際の反映率 = (1 - WorldDampingLocation)\nDamping (suppression) of the Skeletal Mesh Component's world-space movement.\n0 = movement fully reflected (max sway) / 1 = follows component (no reflection). Actual reflection factor = (1 - WorldDampingLocation)."
msgstr "世界坐标系中骨骼网格体组件移动量的阻尼量，0 为完全反映移动量即摇曳最大，1 为跟随组件即不反映，实际反映率为 1 减去该值"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:WorldDampingLocation
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member WorldDampingLocation in KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier (type: FloatProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member WorldDampingLocation in KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier (type: FloatProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:WorldDampingLocation"
msgid "WorldDampingLocationへの倍率。実際の反映率は (1 - WorldDampingLocation) のため意味が反転し、\n1未満の倍率ではコンポーネントの移動量がより強く反映されて揺れが大きくなる\nMultiplier for WorldDampingLocation. The semantics are inverted because the actual reflection factor is\n(1 - WorldDampingLocation): a multiplier below 1 reflects more of the component movement and increases the sway."
msgstr "世界阻尼位置的倍率，由于实际反映率为 1 减去该值因此含义反转，低于 1 的倍率会让组件移动量更强地反映出来，摇曳变大"

#. Key:	MovieSceneKawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplierSection:WorldDampingLocation
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member WorldDampingLocation in MovieSceneKawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplierSection (type: StructProperty, owner: MovieSceneKawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplierSection)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member WorldDampingLocation in MovieSceneKawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplierSection (type: StructProperty, owner: MovieSceneKawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplierSection)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,MovieSceneKawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplierSection:WorldDampingLocation"
msgid "WorldDampingLocationへの倍率。実際の反映率は (1 - WorldDampingLocation) のため意味が反転し、1未満の倍率ではコンポーネントの移動量がより強く反映されて揺れが大きくなる / Multiplier for WorldDampingLocation. The semantics are inverted because the actual reflection factor is (1 - WorldDampingLocation): a multiplier below 1 reflects more of the component movement and increases the sway."
msgstr "世界阻尼位置的倍率，由于实际反映率为 1 减去该值因此含义反转，低于 1 的倍率会让组件移动量更强地反映出来，摇曳变大"

#. Key:	AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics:WorldDampingLocationCurveData
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member WorldDampingLocationCurveData in AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics (type: StructProperty, owner: AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member WorldDampingLocationCurveData in AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics (type: StructProperty, owner: AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics:WorldDampingLocationCurveData"
msgid "各ボーンに適用するPhysics Settings/ WorldDampingLocation パラメータを補正。\n「RootBoneから特定のボーンまでの長さ / RootBoneから末端のボーンまでの長さ」(0.0~1.0)の値におけるカーブの値を各パラメータに乗算\nCorrects the Physics Settings/WorldDampingLocation parameters applied to each bone.\nMultiplies each parameter by the curve value for \"Length from RootBone to specific bone / Length from RootBone to end bone\" (0.0~1.0).\n※基となる値の意味は WorldDampingLocation を参照（大きいほど移動量を抑制 = 反映率は 1 - 値）\nNote: see WorldDampingLocation for the base value's meaning (higher = more suppression; reflection factor = 1 - value)."
msgstr "修正各骨骼应用的物理设置/世界阻尼位置参数，按「根骨骼到特定骨骼的长度 / 根骨骼到末端骨骼的长度」（0.0~1.0）取曲线值并乘到各参数上，基础值含义参见 WorldDampingLocation，越大越抑制移动，反映率为 1 减去该值"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSettings:WorldDampingRotation
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member WorldDampingRotation in KawaiiPhysicsSettings (type: FloatProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysicsSettings)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member WorldDampingRotation in KawaiiPhysicsSettings (type: FloatProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysicsSettings)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysicsSettings:WorldDampingRotation"
msgid "ワールド座標系における Skeletal Mesh Component の回転量のダンピング(抑制)量。\n0 = 回転量をフル反映(揺れ最大) / 1 = コンポーネントに追従(反映なし)。実際の反映率 = (1 - WorldDampingRotation)\nDamping (suppression) of the Skeletal Mesh Component's world-space rotation.\n0 = rotation fully reflected (max sway) / 1 = follows component (no reflection). Actual reflection factor = (1 - WorldDampingRotation)."
msgstr "世界坐标系中骨骼网格体组件旋转量的阻尼量，0 为完全反映旋转量即摇曳最大，1 为跟随组件即不反映，实际反映率为 1 减去该值"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:WorldDampingRotation
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member WorldDampingRotation in KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier (type: FloatProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member WorldDampingRotation in KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier (type: FloatProperty, owner: KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:WorldDampingRotation"
msgid "WorldDampingRotationへの倍率。実際の反映率は (1 - WorldDampingRotation) のため意味が反転し、\n1未満の倍率ではコンポーネントの回転量がより強く反映されて揺れが大きくなる\nMultiplier for WorldDampingRotation. The semantics are inverted because the actual reflection factor is\n(1 - WorldDampingRotation): a multiplier below 1 reflects more of the component rotation and increases the sway."
msgstr "世界阻尼旋转的倍率，由于实际反映率为 1 减去该值因此含义反转，低于 1 的倍率会让组件旋转量更强地反映出来，摇曳变大"

#. Key:	MovieSceneKawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplierSection:WorldDampingRotation
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member WorldDampingRotation in MovieSceneKawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplierSection (type: StructProperty, owner: MovieSceneKawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplierSection)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member WorldDampingRotation in MovieSceneKawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplierSection (type: StructProperty, owner: MovieSceneKawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplierSection)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,MovieSceneKawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplierSection:WorldDampingRotation"
msgid "WorldDampingRotationへの倍率。実際の反映率は (1 - WorldDampingRotation) のため意味が反転し、1未満の倍率ではコンポーネントの回転量がより強く反映されて揺れが大きくなる / Multiplier for WorldDampingRotation. The semantics are inverted because the actual reflection factor is (1 - WorldDampingRotation): a multiplier below 1 reflects more of the component rotation and increases the sway."
msgstr "世界阻尼旋转的倍率，由于实际反映率为 1 减去该值因此含义反转，低于 1 的倍率会让组件旋转量更强地反映出来，摇曳变大"

#. Key:	AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics:WorldDampingRotationCurveData
#. SourceLocation:	Meta-data for key ToolTip of member WorldDampingRotationCurveData in AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics (type: StructProperty, owner: AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics)
#: Meta-data for key ToolTip of member WorldDampingRotationCurveData in AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics (type: StructProperty, owner: AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics)
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,AnimNode_KawaiiPhysics:WorldDampingRotationCurveData"
msgid "各ボーンに適用するPhysics Settings/ WorldDampingRotation パラメータを補正。\n「RootBoneから特定のボーンまでの長さ / RootBoneから末端のボーンまでの長さ」(0.0~1.0)の値におけるカーブの値を各パラメータに乗算\nCorrects the Physics Settings/WorldDampingRotation parameters applied to each bone.\nMultiplies each parameter by the curve value for \"Length from RootBone to specific bone / Length from RootBone to end bone\" (0.0~1.0).\n※基となる値の意味は WorldDampingRotation を参照（大きいほど回転量を抑制 = 反映率は 1 - 値）\nNote: see WorldDampingRotation for the base value's meaning (higher = more suppression; reflection factor = 1 - value)."
msgstr "修正各骨骼应用的物理设置/世界阻尼旋转参数，按「根骨骼到特定骨骼的长度 / 根骨骼到末端骨骼的长度」（0.0~1.0）取曲线值并乘到各参数上，基础值含义参见 WorldDampingRotation，越大越抑制旋转，反映率为 1 减去该值"

